{"4093640": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Psych Rift", "steam_appid": 4093640, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093640/extras/c56408b26dfbba898a59338c9afb8502.poster.avif?t=1781302639\" width=780 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093640/extras/c56408b26dfbba898a59338c9afb8502.webm?t=1781302639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093640/extras/c56408b26dfbba898a59338c9afb8502.mp4?t=1781302639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You wake up in an abandoned, underground 1960s research lab, overtaken by an evil dark entity from another dimension. As you look for a way out, you discover the nightmares of the researchers have been turned into reality, and you must battle through supernatural encounters to put an end to the madness. No matter the cost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093640/extras/76f0095e463a08c67d6ce4b0543e4ffb.poster.avif?t=1781302639\" width=780 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093640/extras/76f0095e463a08c67d6ce4b0543e4ffb.webm?t=1781302639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093640/extras/76f0095e463a08c67d6ce4b0543e4ffb.mp4?t=1781302639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Each nightmare world is ruled by a unique, unkillable monster which you must avoid, defeat or befriend to complete your objective. Discover their stories, strengths and weaknesses and use them to your advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093640/extras/78fc42525cf0527864615440c2c3cb46.avif?t=1781302639\" width=784 height=384 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Shadow:</strong> Use stealth to quietly sneak through the nightmare and reach your objective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Wrath:</strong> Battle the nightmare and complete the tasks required to defeat it and reach your objective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Mercy:</strong> Find a peaceful resolution to befriend the nightmare and reach your objective</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093640/extras/598b3b7e8991067bb94097e8651c7a76.poster.avif?t=1781302639\" width=780 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093640/extras/598b3b7e8991067bb94097e8651c7a76.webm?t=1781302639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093640/extras/598b3b7e8991067bb94097e8651c7a76.mp4?t=1781302639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Explore various reality-bending locations, and avoid a multitude of threats to progress. Gravity shifts, sinister traps, transforming rooms and impossible mazes will test your instinct to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093640/extras/b002fbc1f8b774ebf2898d7532040074.poster.avif?t=1781302639\" width=780 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093640/extras/b002fbc1f8b774ebf2898d7532040074.webm?t=1781302639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093640/extras/b002fbc1f8b774ebf2898d7532040074.mp4?t=1781302639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Use the telekinetic glove to pull, levitate and throw almost any object in the game; smash walls, solve physics puzzles and distract monsters. In a place with no weapons, everything is a weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093640/extras/ed23ced5a1ec229d905c3faebee286e1.poster.avif?t=1781302639\" width=780 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093640/extras/ed23ced5a1ec229d905c3faebee286e1.webm?t=1781302639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093640/extras/ed23ced5a1ec229d905c3faebee286e1.mp4?t=1781302639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Uncover side activities and puzzles tucked into each nightmare world, but don't expect to relax for long as you never know when you are being watched.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093640/extras/fc952d9def6ff325938b70d9f7db3ad4.poster.avif?t=1781302639\" width=780 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093640/extras/fc952d9def6ff325938b70d9f7db3ad4.webm?t=1781302639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093640/extras/fc952d9def6ff325938b70d9f7db3ad4.mp4?t=1781302639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Key features include:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Multiple Nightmare Worlds with Unique Bosses</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">3 Ways to Play: Avoid, Defeat, Befriend</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Physics &amp; Telekinesis</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Reality-bending Environments with Secrets</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Tense Monster Chases</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Main Story with Multiple Endings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Activities &amp; Puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">ABOUT THE DEVELOPER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Hi, my name is Tiberiu and I am the developer of Psych Rift. I have a great passion for games, coding and art. Psych Rift is a project born from the wish to craft a surreal experience, and draws inpiration from horror and supernatural  media across games, film and TV. I'm always happy to get in touch with people interested in the project, so feel free to use the links on this page and reach out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">See you in the Rift!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"ht